{"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/reversed()"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Inherited from "},{"code":"Sequence.reversed()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/reversed()"]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"reversed"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Element","preciseIdentifier":"s:ST7ElementQa"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"modules":[{"name":"Cliques","relatedModules":["Swift"]}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:STsE8reversedSay7ElementQzGyF::SYNTHESIZED::s:7Cliques07MaximalA0V","title":"reversed()","extendedModule":"Swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"reversed"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Element","preciseIdentifier":"s:ST7ElementQa"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"references":{"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques":{"type":"topic","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","title":"Cliques","url":"\/documentation\/cliques"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MaximalCliques","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MaximalCliques","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every maximal clique of an undirected graph’s simple graph once, lazily, each in "},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order (by vertex index): an isolated vertex, or one whose only edges are loops, is a clique of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one. The order is Eppstein–Löffler–Strash’s: by the cliques’ first vertex in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"coreNumbers().degeneracyOrdering","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", then as Bron–Kerbosch with Tomita’s pivot (ties to the least"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"index) and branches in ascending index meets them. The sequence holds the graph, so iterating"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"again gives the same cliques. O(n + m) before the first clique, O(d·n·3^(d\/3)) in all for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"degeneracy d."}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MaximalCliques","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques/reversed()":{"abstract":[],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"reversed()","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/reversed()","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"reversed"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ST7ElementQa","text":"Element"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/reversed()"}}}